            "id": 70691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il confronto di uguaglianza tra <code>inboxFull</code> e <code>true</code> all'interno di <code>showAlert</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert = inboxFull === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showAlert) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your inbox is full.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't receive any more emails&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inboxFull !== true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your inbox is full.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"You can't receive any more emails\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>inboxFull === true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi salvare un confronto in una variabile e usare quella variabile come condizione.</p><p>Memorizza il confronto di uguaglianza tra <code>inboxFull</code> e il valore booleano <code>true</code> in <code>showAlert</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert = inboxFull === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showAlert) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your inbox is full.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't receive any more emails&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"showAlert\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your inbox is full.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"You can't receive any more emails\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>inboxFull</code>, seguito da <code>===</code> e infine <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
